id=malachite_wifi_monitor
name=malachite: Wi-Fi monitor mode + injection (TEST)
version=1.2-active-swap
versionCode=12
author=noamtu123
description=TEST. On each boot, actively unloads the stock gen4m Wi-Fi driver and loads source builds (wlan + cfg80211 + mac80211) that add native monitor mode and packet injection; bundles airodump-ng/aireplay-ng. Fail-safe: never unloads stock unless a restorable stock copy exists, and auto-restores stock if ours does not bring wlan0 up (Wi-Fi is never left broken - worst case is plain stock after a reboot). After reboot check /data/adb/malachite_wifi_monitor/swap.log (insmod wlan rc=0, wlan0 up, monitor-capable>=1). Authorized security testing only. Remove + reboot to go back to stock.
